{"id":304,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"早稲田精神を基盤に知性と国際性を伸ばす","feature_description":"早稲田佐賀は、早稲田の「学問の独立」の精神のもと、基礎と応用の学力を育て、豊かな人間性を備えたグローバルリーダーを目指す六年一貫教育を行います。学習と部活動、生徒会や学校行事を両輪として、学年を越えて協働する経験を重ねます。唐津の自然や文化を生かした学習、寮生活による人間教育など、地域と日々の生活を通じて広い視野を育てています。","clubs":[{"id":5425,"name":"競走部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.wasedasaga.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":5426,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.wasedasaga.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":5429,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.wasedasaga.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":5430,"name":"応援部（チアリーディング）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.wasedasaga.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":5431,"name":"弓道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.wasedasaga.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":5432,"name":"吹奏楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.wasedasaga.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":5433,"name":"美術部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.wasedasaga.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":5434,"name":"書道部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.wasedasaga.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":5435,"name":"放送部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.wasedasaga.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":5436,"name":"サイエンス部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.wasedasaga.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":5437,"name":"写真部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.wasedasaga.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":5438,"name":"ESS部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.wasedasaga.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14519,"name":"野球部（軟式）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.wasedasaga.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14520,"name